pping Your Child? \u2018There Are Solid Rational Reasons For It,\u2019 Say Supreme Overlords Of The WEF)\n\nBut the funniest comment of the week came from Norway\u2019s minister of Foreign Affairs, Espen Barth Eide, who said: \u201cIt is the first time that the world unites around such a clear text on the need to transition away from fossil fuels.\u201d It is literally the 26th time such an agreement has been made. And guess what happened after all the other agreements? Absolutely nothing, other than our freedoms being removed without our consent. These people are a joke, and I don\u2019t even know if they realize how blatantly they\u2019re blatantly spreading propaganda. Perhaps they actually think we\u2019re stupid enough to believe them? If so, what does that say about us?", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Leadership", "roles": [{"name": "Leader", "filler": "oligarchs", "idxs": [17, 17]}, {"name": "Type", "filler": "globalist", "idxs": [16, 16]}], "idxs": [17, 17], "activation": "oligarchs"}, {"name": "Undergo_change", "roles": [{"name": "Entity", "filler": "climate", "idxs": [42, 42]}], "idxs": [43, 43], "activation": "change"}, {"name": "Ordinal_numbers", "roles": [{"name": "Type", "filler": "decade", "idxs": [27, 27]}], "idxs": [26, 26], "activation": "third"}, {"name": "Firefighting", "roles": [{"name": "Fire", "filler": "\u201c climate change \u201d", "idxs": [41, 44]}, {"name": "Instrument", "filler": "by cutting fossil fuel emissions", "idxs": [45, 49]}, {"name": "Firefighter", "filler": "their", "idxs": [37, 37]}], "idxs": [40, 40], "activation": "fight"}, {"name": "Calendric_unit", "roles": [{"name": "Unit", "filler": "December", "idxs": [20, 20]}], "idxs": [20, 20], "activation": "December"}, {"name": "Aggregate", "roles": [{"name": "Individuals", "filler": "of mostly unelected globalist oligarchs", "idxs": [13, 17]}, {"name": "Aggregate", "filler": "group", "idxs": [12, 12]}], "idxs": [12, 12], "activation": "gr